WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:23.529
This is like the first time my art has ever
been in a gallery so this is a pretty

00:00:23.529 --> 00:00:27.310
cool experience coming in as a freshmen
like I didn't imagine my art would be

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:31.330
in the student center. That was
really cool and it was also just like

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.839
really nice to see a lot of
different artists from like

00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:39.280
there's like grad students in this
program, there's undergrad students, like this whole

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.680
wide range of different people with
different experiences and it just all comes

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.900
together in one gallery.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:56.920
The opportunity to experience new forms of expression

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:02.230
is a really valuable experience for
undergraduates and graduates and I'm really

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:05.789
glad that the art scholars gives us that
opportunity

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:13.330
What's most rewarding for me is seeing the
new Wiesner gallery because I have had

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:18.520
art displayed here in the old one and
the new one is just so much better it

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.970
feels like an art gallery now and that's
really exciting. So this is I think much

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:28.290
nicer to have here because it does feel
more like a space that is for art.

